    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Herringen is a free-flight arcade bomber game with a retro aesthetic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control a ship armed with heavy explosives and are tasked with taking down an impossibly large Fortress under a moody, colour-compressed sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade attacks, take breakneck trajectories through obstacles and destroy your target as fast as you can to improve your score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/59e9b678d185a0ba5758090a18abdb25.poster.avif?t=1740590927\" width=696 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/59e9b678d185a0ba5758090a18abdb25.webm?t=1740590927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/59e9b678d185a0ba5758090a18abdb25.mp4?t=1740590927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying Evades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp reflexes are rewarded with astonishing speed and a full reload of your bombs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depth &amp; Inertia</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering movement  will make the difference between life and death. Know the weight of your ship, let it become an extension of your body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/ad4ef34306424eced47cdc3f19896f47.poster.avif?t=1740590927\" width=630 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/ad4ef34306424eced47cdc3f19896f47.webm?t=1740590927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/ad4ef34306424eced47cdc3f19896f47.mp4?t=1740590927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Imposing Fortress</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many interconnected paths are available to you: understand the architecture of your target and obliterate it.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power from Danger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy projectile an opportunity to reload, every obstacle an agility boost. Play on an absolute razor's edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scoring &amp; Leaderboard</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroying the Fortress is one thing, doing it well is another. Learn, try again, improve your score and climb the leaderboard.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/99cba0882ff0604deacb04fec60a5716.poster.avif?t=1740590927\" width=650 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/99cba0882ff0604deacb04fec60a5716.webm?t=1740590927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/99cba0882ff0604deacb04fec60a5716.mp4?t=1740590927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Herringen is a free-flight arcade bomber game with a retro aesthetic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control a ship armed with heavy explosives and are tasked with taking down an impossibly large Fortress under a moody, colour-compressed sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade attacks, take breakneck trajectories through obstacles and destroy your target as fast as you can to improve your score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/59e9b678d185a0ba5758090a18abdb25.poster.avif?t=1740590927\" width=696 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/59e9b678d185a0ba5758090a18abdb25.webm?t=1740590927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/59e9b678d185a0ba5758090a18abdb25.mp4?t=1740590927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying Evades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp reflexes are rewarded with astonishing speed and a full reload of your bombs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depth &amp; Inertia</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering movement  will make the difference between life and death. Know the weight of your ship, let it become an extension of your body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/ad4ef34306424eced47cdc3f19896f47.poster.avif?t=1740590927\" width=630 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/ad4ef34306424eced47cdc3f19896f47.webm?t=1740590927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/ad4ef34306424eced47cdc3f19896f47.mp4?t=1740590927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Imposing Fortress</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many interconnected paths are available to you: understand the architecture of your target and obliterate it.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power from Danger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy projectile an opportunity to reload, every obstacle an agility boost. Play on an absolute razor's edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scoring &amp; Leaderboard</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroying the Fortress is one thing, doing it well is another. Learn, try again, improve your score and climb the leaderboard.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/99cba0882ff0604deacb04fec60a5716.poster.avif?t=1740590927\" width=650 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/99cba0882ff0604deacb04fec60a5716.webm?t=1740590927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/99cba0882ff0604deacb04fec60a5716.mp4?t=1740590927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
